{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo is a short 15-20 minute snippet (depending on skill) of Blinding Lite! The full version of this game will include 14  levels and various towns and story sections!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, kick, and dive your way through <strong>Blinding Lite</strong>! Explore a wide world full of colorful characters and levels washed in <strong>8-BIT</strong> glory! Take control of Lite, the loveable ghostly crow on a mission to save the Elementals, godly beings who have been captured. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the source of the Fragments, and set them free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944690/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.poster.avif?t=1755354861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944690/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.webm?t=1755354861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944690/extras/0124676617bda96d4f7a39ac039951d7.mp4?t=1755354861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinding Lite is tuned for maximum momentum building and acrobatic movement that ties right into the combat. Any movement ability doubles as an attack of some sort! From diving beak-first into your enemies or a swift kick from above, the combat will always keep you on the move!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944690?t=1755354861","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394469